<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Staff Sign Up — Alshifa Clinic</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg-ivory: #FBF8F5;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --red-deep: #6E1423;
    --red-accent: #A31D2E;
    --charcoal: #201C1B;
    --grey: #6B615E;
    --hairline: rgba(32, 28, 27, 0.14);
    --radius: 3px;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  h1, .brand { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; }

  .panel {
    position: relative;
    background:
      linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(30,10,14,0.9) 10%, rgba(110,20,35,0.55) 60%, rgba(110,20,35,0.25) 100%),
      url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .panel .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .panel .brand .mark { width: 9px; height: 9px; background: var(--white); border-radius: 50%; }

  .panel .quote { max-width: 380px; }
  .panel .quote h2 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .panel .quote p { color: #E7CFCF; font-size: 0.92rem; }

  .form-panel {
    background: var(--bg-ivory);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .form-box { width: 100%; max-width: 400px; }

  .form-box .eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--red-accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .form-box h1 { font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .form-box .sub { color: var(--grey); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 28px; }

  /* Role toggle */
  .role-toggle {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }

  .role-option {
    position: relative;
  }

  .role-option input {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .role-option label {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 14px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--white);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--grey);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .role-option input:checked + label {
    border-color: var(--red-deep);
    background: var(--red-deep);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .field { margin-bottom: 18px; }

  .field label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--charcoal);
  }

  .field input, .field select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .field input:focus, .field select:focus { border-color: var(--red-accent); }
  .field input::placeholder { color: #B0A6A4; }

  .row-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }

  /* Only shown when Doctor role is selected */
  .doctor-only { display: none; }
  .doctor-only.active { display: block; }

  .btn-primary {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--red-deep);
    color: var(--white);
    border: none;
    padding: 14px;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 8px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--red-accent); }

  .switch-link {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--grey);
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .switch-link a { color: var(--red-deep); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .switch-link a:hover { color: var(--red-accent); }

  .note {
    background: #F4E3E1;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--red-deep);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--red-deep);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .panel { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="panel">
    
    <div class="quote">
      <h2>Staff access, built around real clinic roles.</h2>
      <p>Doctors and receptionists each get an account suited to what they do — patient records stay attached to the clinic, not a login.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-panel">
    <form action="/users/signup" method="post">
    <div class="form-box">
      <span class="eyebrow">Staff Registration</span>
      <h1>Create a staff account</h1>
      <p class="sub">This account is for clinic staff only — patient records are added by staff, not self-registered.</p>

      <form id="signupForm">
        <div class="role-toggle">
          <div class="role-option">
            <input type="radio" id="roleDoctor" name="role" value="doctor" checked>
            <label for="roleDoctor">Doctor</label>
          </div>
          <div class="role-option">
            <input type="radio" id="roleReceptionist" name="role" value="receptionist">
            <label for="roleReceptionist">Receptionist</label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="name">Username</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="Username" placeholder="Enter username" required>
        </div>


        

        <div class="field">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@clinic.pk" required>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="password">Password</label>
          <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Create a password" required>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Create Staff Account</button>
      </form>

      <p class="switch-link">Already have an account? <a href="/login">Log in</a></p>
    </div>
    </form>
  </div>

  <script>
    const roleInputs = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="role"]');
    const specialtyField = document.getElementById('specialtyField');

    roleInputs.forEach(input => {
      input.addEventListener('change', () => {
        specialtyField.classList.toggle('active', input.value === 'doctor' && input.checked);
      });
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>